"contacts a contact is connected to, how, and how strongly, on the partner form\n"
"and through ``_get_blocklisted_relatives()``.\n"
"\n"
"**It flags. It does not refuse.** ``l10n_mx_partner_blocklist`` still refuses a\n"
"CFDI only for a partner listed in its own right. Extending a refusal to relatives\n"
"is a compliance judgement about *partes relacionadas* that belongs to whoever\n"
"owns that policy, not to this module.\n"
