"* Push notifications to registered devices for direct messages, chatter "
"messages and channel.\n"
"* Redirection to the Android/iOS mobile app when you click on an Odoo URL.\n"
"* Mobile back-button handling for the file viewer, chat window and messaging menu.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mail_oauth2
msgid ""
"\n"
"Mail OAuth2\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"Provides ``mixin.oauth2.mail.provider``, the abstract authorization-code flow\n"
"shared by every OAuth2 mail provider: the authorization URI, the IAP fallback,\n"
"the token exchange and refresh, the CSRF token, and the XOAUTH2 SASL string.\n"
"\n"
"A provider supplies its endpoints and its identifiers through a handful of\n"
"class attributes and hooks, and declares its own credential fields under its\n"
"own prefix. It does not restate the flow.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_maintenance
msgid ""
"\n"
"Maintenance Approvals\n"
"=====================\n"
"\n"
"Approval categories for equipment maintenance, tied to\n"
"``asset_ledger_maintenance``.\n"
"\n"
"* two seeded categories: Mantenimiento Preventivo (``maintenance_preventive``)\n"
"  and Mantenimiento Correctivo (``maintenance_corrective``), approved by\n"
"  ``stock.group_stock_manager``\n"
"* both require an amount, a product, a quantity and a document, so a quotation\n"
"  and a cost estimate are attached before approval\n"
"* a maintenance order is confirmed only once its approval is granted, so\n"
"  approval precedes sending equipment out for maintenance\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
