#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_mercado_pago
msgid ""
"# Mercado Pago\n"
"\n"
"## Technical details\n"
"\n"
"APIs:\n"
"- [Checkout Pro](https://www.mercadopago.com.mx/developers/en/docs/checkout-pro/overview)\n"
